# Conformance probe pack for groups and kinds (spec 0.7) on the `json` wire.
# Public. A common group, a group inside a kind, and `requires <list>`: encode
# picks `listed` only when the entity has the list with at least one item.
format  conformance-groups-kinds
version 0.7.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses    probe
wire    json
field   uid  id  string
group   probe.names  names
  field  probe.tag  .  string
end
kind     listed
when     shape  listed
requires probe.items
group    probe.items  items
  field  probe.label  name  string
end
kind     bare
when     shape  bare
